{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Project X</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Project X</strong>, a first-person survival horror experience that traps you in the cold, dark corridors of an abandoned subway station. What begins as a routine visit turns into a chilling fight for your life when you find yourself <strong>trapped underground</strong>\u2026 and you're not alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something is down here with you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It <strong>doesn't speak</strong>. <br>It <strong>doesn't breathe</strong>. <br>It <strong>doesn't even make a sound when it moves</strong>. <br>But it knows you're here.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong>:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unnerving Atmosphere</strong>: Explore a pitch-black, decaying subway system filled with ambient dread and eerie stillness. The only sounds you'll hear... are your own.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sound-Based Stealth</strong>: The creature <strong>can\u2019t hear</strong>, but that doesn't mean you're safe. It moves without warning and without sound\u2014making every shadow, every turn, and every silence a potential death sentence.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzle-Based Escape</strong>: Solve environmental puzzles, find hidden pathways, and piece together the tragic story of what happened in the station before it's your turn to disappear.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic AI</strong>: The monster doesn\u2019t follow a script. It roams. It watches. It waits. You\u2019ll never know when it\u2019s near\u2026 until it\u2019s too late.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Horror</strong>: Stunning visuals and immersive audio design plunge you into a claustrophobic nightmare. Can you keep your nerves long enough to escape?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You came here by choice. </strong><br><strong>Leaving\u2026 might not be an option.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Project X</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899180/extras/project_b12?t=1762075914\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899180/extras/35b50b86c309de17869026985bbf595e.avif?t=1762075914\" width=1600 height=752 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899180/extras/63df6a23b3df1a34d65c5185df9ac354.avif?t=1762075914\" width=1600 height=762 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899180/extras/3d4d7e1b927ff69b0349024997effd2d.avif?t=1762075914\" width=1600 height=758 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899180/extras/e0fbed790d31343ffe6ef50ce201cab9.avif?t=1762075914\" width=1600 height=900 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899180/extras/2437588a5e2bf554eb9ce205105a9781.avif?t=1762075914\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3899180?t=1762075914","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3899180?t=1762075914","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899180/9c1bcdf5a2a4f4eea5b61f69a3e93ddeec6c4b27/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762075914","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899180/9c1bcdf5a2a4f4eea5b61f69a3e93ddeec6c4b27/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762075914","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Cust